{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/77ebeeca1c61088250e59a439c0d1488.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/77ebeeca1c61088250e59a439c0d1488.webm?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/77ebeeca1c61088250e59a439c0d1488.mp4?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A round of physics comedy where everyone takes flight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Head</strong> is a multiplayer party brawler for up to <strong>8 players</strong> who slip, grab, and throw one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short ~2-minute rounds and ever-changing gimmicks and supply drops keep the fun fresh every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginners pick it up fast and quickly shout \u201cone more game.\u201d Enjoy the fast pace and light learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/82b53661bfc2d9132a7a7d05a0911f59.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/82b53661bfc2d9132a7a7d05a0911f59.webm?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/82b53661bfc2d9132a7a7d05a0911f59.mp4?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is packed with <strong>varied interactive elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage the terrain to seize <strong>advantageous positions</strong>, and time your moves to <strong>grab items</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With smart positioning and a clutch play, go for the <strong>last one standing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One choice can decide the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/268b586baa332215ad1795b25e6515c6.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/268b586baa332215ad1795b25e6515c6.webm?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/268b586baa332215ad1795b25e6515c6.mp4?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Gimmicks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>zero-gravity</strong> moments to <strong>incoming cannon fire</strong>, a variety of gimmicks keeps you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them\u2014or avoid them\u2014and adapt your strategy on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small decision can trigger a chain reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the flow and strike back; the laughs and cheers will be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/a5ab8da4a1fde5fd14e97dca9691c349.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/a5ab8da4a1fde5fd14e97dca9691c349.webm?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/a5ab8da4a1fde5fd14e97dca9691c349.mp4?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield <strong>152</strong> different weapons\u2014melee, ranged, and explosive\u2014to create fresh combinations every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some come with <strong>special effects</strong> that flip the battlefield in an instant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Electrocute your foes</strong> or <strong>manipulate gravity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match spawns new combos; which weapon steals the spotlight is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/c7d12f8b2199c9e322710339156b2c0a.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/c7d12f8b2199c9e322710339156b2c0a.webm?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/c7d12f8b2199c9e322710339156b2c0a.mp4?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It\u2019s Okay to Get Knocked Out</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you\u2019re out, the show goes on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return in a <strong>ghost state</strong> and <strong>disrupt</strong> your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small prank can sway the momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting eliminated isn\u2019t the end\u2014find another way to get even.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053350?t=1759511911","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053350?t=1759511911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/0fee8f1f2ad5dcec446692156be3ec22effa1347/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759511911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/0fee8f1f2ad5dcec446692156be3ec22effa1347/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759511911","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/77ebeeca1c61088250e59a439c0d1488.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/77ebeeca1c61088250e59a439c0d1488.webm?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/77ebeeca1c61088250e59a439c0d1488.mp4?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A round of physics comedy where everyone takes flight.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Big Head</strong> is a multiplayer party brawler for up to <strong>8 players</strong> who slip, grab, and throw one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short ~2-minute rounds and ever-changing gimmicks and supply drops keep the fun fresh every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beginners pick it up fast and quickly shout \u201cone more game.\u201d Enjoy the fast pace and light learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/82b53661bfc2d9132a7a7d05a0911f59.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/82b53661bfc2d9132a7a7d05a0911f59.webm?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/82b53661bfc2d9132a7a7d05a0911f59.mp4?t=1759511911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the Environment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is packed with <strong>varied interactive elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage the terrain to seize <strong>advantageous positions</strong>, and time your moves to <strong>grab items</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With smart positioning and a clutch play, go for the <strong>last one standing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One choice can decide the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053350/extras/268b586baa332215ad1795b25e6515c6.poster.avif?t=1759511911\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as